  "description": "Delightful first floor two bedroom apartment available immediately. Comfortable and bright open plan kitchen living dining area, two double bedroom - both with built-in wardrobes and wood effect floors. New and modern bathroom with shower only. Communal parking, electric heating, strictly no pets. Only careful tenants may apply.\n\n**In order to apply, please send your Expression of Interest to us by email**\n\n** What is an Expression of Interest? An Expression of Interest is an opportunity to present yourself in a clear and precise document/email. It is an opportunity to provide important information and to demonstrate applicants' suitability, interest, availability in relation to the property. Subject to demand we may use this document/email to help us schedule viewings so please try and include all relevant information. Please note that submission of an Expression of Interest does not guarantee a viewing. \n\nIMPORTANT: Due to the volume of emails we receive for each property, unfortunately we are unable to reply to each one received. We thank you for taking the time to submit your Expression of Interest and we will be in contact in due course - either to offer you a viewing of the property or to advise the property is no longer available. Thank you.",
